cheat.settings_page.detail:
Opens the Settings page; when it is already open, pressing it returns to the search page (the same step as Esc's “back from Settings to search”).
`F2` is an alias added in batch B8 (2026-10-26, requirement spec appendix A); both keys run the same code path;
it also works while the Settings page is already open (like `F1` it is “whole-window level”, and the key is taken before the page switch).
